<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1718657004"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:41.347"><div begin="27.396" end="54.182" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="27.396" end="33.595" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.396" end="29.186">日出又日</span><span begin="29.186" end="30.866">落</span> <span begin="30.866" end="32.497">深处再深</span><span begin="32.497" end="33.595">处</span></p><p begin="34.296" end="40.514" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.296" end="35.995">一张小方</span><span begin="35.995" end="37.742">桌</span> <span begin="37.742" end="39.359">有一荤一</span><span begin="39.359" end="40.514">素</span></p><p begin="41.158" end="47.277" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.158" end="42.795">一个身影</span><span begin="42.795" end="43.660">从</span><span begin="43.660" end="45.404">容地忙忙</span><span begin="45.404" end="47.277">碌碌</span></p><p begin="48.038" end="54.182" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.038" end="50.056">一双手让这</span><span begin="50.056" end="50.981">时</span><span begin="50.981" end="52.280">光有了</span><span begin="52.280" end="54.182">温度</span></p></div><div begin="54.827" end="1:24.000" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="54.827" end="1:01.194" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.827" end="56.559">太年轻的</span><span begin="56.559" end="57.857">人</span> <span begin="57.857" end="59.926">他总是不满</span><span begin="59.926" end="1:01.194">足</span></p><p begin="1:01.734" end="1:07.581" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.734" end="1:03.435">固执地不</span><span begin="1:03.435" end="1:04.238">愿</span><span begin="1:04.238" end="1:06.869">停下 远行的脚</span><span begin="1:06.869" end="1:07.581">步</span></p><p begin="1:07.771" end="1:14.994" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.771" end="1:08.600">望着</span><span begin="1:08.600" end="1:10.195">高高的</span><span begin="1:10.195" end="1:10.860">天</span> <span begin="1:11.088" end="1:11.963">走了</span><span begin="1:11.963" end="1:13.726">长长的</span><span begin="